t only to be available everywhere, but also to make every moment of capturing, planning, and completing feel reliable, intuitive, and smooth."}),(0,g.jsx)("br",{}),(0,g.jsx)("p",{className:f().textContent,children:"Today, tens of millions of people have grown with TickTick. They found us at different points in their lives, from students on campus to professionals across a wide range of industries. Each of them uses TickTick in their own way to plan their time, accomplish their goals, and gradually develop a rhythm that works for them."}),(0,g.jsx)("br",{}),(0,g.jsx)("p",{className:f().textContent,children:"We also use TickTick every day to move work forward, organize our lives, and keep track of the moments we do not want to lose. We are both its creators and its users. The problems it addresses are part of our own days, and the friction we encounter and ideas we discover through everyday use continue to motivate us to make the product better."}),(0,g.jsx)("br",{}),(0,g.jsx)("p",{className:f().textContent,children:"Over the years, TickTick has received recognition from app stores and the media. But what gives our work its deepest sense of meaning is seeing the difference the product makes in people\u2019s real lives. We see people who have used TickTick for thousands of days and completed thousands, or even tens of thousands, of tasks. We also see people share what they have learned, helping others find approaches that work for them. Feedback can lead to meaningful improvements, while years of using TickTick can gradually turn into lasting changes in someone\u2019s life. These specific, genuine moments are what we value most."}),(0,g.jsx)("br",{}),(0,g.jsx)("p",{className:f().textContent,children:"From a simple list to a tool that brings together tasks, schedules, focus, habits, and important occasions, TickTick continues to move forward. In the years ahead, we will keep learning from the changing ways people work and live. We will embrace new platforms and technolo